      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOO EASY (1) was well supported last time and gave a sight after a fast early split but could manage only the minor money, finishing a one length second (19.37) over 340m at this track. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FABRICATOR (2) ran below his best last time finishing fifth (30.52) over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won four of six tries. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to feature in the finish. RONALDO VELLA (8) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (22.64) last time out at this track. Has a strong record here including two wins. Hard to beat again. HAWKESBURY HONEY (3) was out of placings last time (30.21) at Gosford in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 8 lengths. Has already won out of this draw.",
